       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose looks wrong and I want to check with you first.\n\n**Amlodipine 50 mg once daily is 5 times the maximum recommended dose.** The usual adult dose is 2.5\u201310 mg once daily, and 10 mg is the maximum. At 50 mg the patient could develop serious low blood pressure, reflex tachycardia or shock. Amlodipine overdose is hard to reverse because the drug stays in the body for a long time.\n\nThis could be a typo for **5 mg** (a common starting dose) or 10 mg. Which did you mean?\n\n- **5 mg** by mouth once daily\n- **10 mg** by mouth once daily\n- **Another dose.** If you really mean 50 mg, tell me why and I'll add your reasoning as a note on the order. Pharmacy will probably still flag it for review.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order."
